<title>UK: Telkom at $30.6 in London.</title>
<headline>Telkom at $30.6 in London.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed  at $30.6 in London on Friday. It recorded the day's low of $30.45  and the day's high of $30.625.</p>
<p>Its previous close on Thursday as $30.75.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364.</p>
</text>
